# No competitor references on the website

Never name or compare to competitor streaming tools (StreamElements, Nightbot, Streamlabs, etc.) in user-facing UI, marketing copy, docs shown to creators, or dashboard helper text.

## Allowed

- Import flows where the user is connecting to or importing from a specific external service (e.g. StreamElements JWT import, Nightbot OAuth).
- Internal code comments, migrations, ADRs, and tests (not shown to end users).

## Not allowed

- "Like StreamElements…", "similar to…", "SE-style", or any feature comparison on the site.
- Positioning Creator Castle by referencing another product's features or setup steps.

## Instead

- Describe what Creator Castle does in plain language.
- For import compatibility, say "legacy import syntax" or "when importing commands" — not the competitor brand outside the import UI.
